# OBJECTIVE

Before writing ANY frontend code, you must completely understand the backend.

You are NOT allowed to implement a single Angular component until you fully understand the backend.

You must reverse engineer the backend.

The backend is the specification.

The backend is the documentation.

The backend is the source of truth.

------------------------------------------------------------

# STEP 1

Read the entire backend recursively.

Never skip files.

Inspect every project.

Inspect every folder.

Inspect every source file.

Read

API

Application

Domain

Infrastructure

Shared

Persistence

Authentication

Authorization

AI

SignalR

Services

Repositories

Validators

Configurations

Middlewares

Everything.

------------------------------------------------------------

